GEMINI_API_KEY=  🔐 API Key & Security Notice

# Developed by: Prince Kumar Singh

# For security and privacy reasons, the live Gemini API key has been intentionally removed from this public GitHub repository.

# The API key is a private credential and should not be publicly exposed, shared, or committed to version control. Therefore, this repository does not contain any personal or active API credentials.

# What works without the API key

# The following parts of PaudhCare AI can still be explored and reviewed:

# Website interface and responsive design
# Navigation and user interface
# Plant image upload interface
# Camera capture interface
# Language selection and multilingual UI
# Project information and feature sections
# Frontend user experience
# Plant Health Report interface and PDF generation features, where applicable
# Overall project structure and source code
# What requires the API key

# The following functionality requires a valid Google Gemini API key configured on the user's local/server environment:

# Live AI-powered plant image analysis
# AI-based plant/crop identification
# AI-based plant health or disease assessment
# AI-generated symptoms and observations
# AI-generated treatment and plant-care guidance
# Other live Gemini-powered analysis features

# Without a valid API key and the required server-side configuration, the live AI analysis functionality will not operate.

# How to enable AI analysis

# To run the complete AI-powered functionality locally, configure your own Gemini API key using the environment variable:

# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# The actual API key must be kept private and should never be committed to GitHub.

# Privacy & Security

# The API key has been excluded specifically to protect credentials and maintain responsible security practices. Each user or developer running the project locally should use their own API credentials and follow the applicable API provider's terms and security recommendations.

# PaudhCare AI
# Developed by Prince Kumar Singh
# AI-Powered Plant Health Assistant

